extrema desde el primer d\u00eda. Sigue a Xploit ZERO en redes sociales y ay\u00fadanos a llevar la innovaci\u00f3n a\u00fan m\u00e1s lejos.", "short_description": "Xploit ZERO es el juego de acci\u00f3n y estrategia en Realidad Mixta que convierte tu habitaci\u00f3n en un campo de batalla. Piensa r\u00e1pido, construye tus defensas y reacciona en tiempo real para repeler a los invasores en partidas cortas, intensas y llenas de diversi\u00f3n. \u00bfTe atreves?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Xploit_zero_360.2.png", "id": "26529534970073330", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595136811_26529534980073329_7286307846810146766_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tLVvbI4jdQAQ7kNvwEzt1fT&_nc_oc=AdpxmCyiN_BawAEqfYCxE8pIx-mOGACYr9Vc7ZA2GWU7wl4E6MiRDVbgynL3PGsjGfs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPgqIudvhDVf4lQsNfQi8r5vCjQvipeuxeaM5of3HnQnw&oe=6ADF6FD6"}, {"file_name": "Shot2.png", "id": "26394552166891673", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828104_26394552180225005_6856735165680477736_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OHki9LE_mIQQ7kNvwGQvVbB&_nc_oc=AdopENwVwCRLkwRA7IlXR_OpSIcSi5Mw2-1A-BPHejOOk6lKwFVWNAm9UBVaYXCorII&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNH_pwm1f6h9npKA4Zi6QHlvdRiaPSJqQxTdVlxHEje_Q&oe=6ADF7722"}, {"file_name": "Shot5.png", "id": "3160157457501506", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298502_3160157460834839_8317283677516400765_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-ffpR4tTt3UQ7kNvwFbJB3m&_nc_oc=AdqFHUOAz7kcy36LIVQ9Xpnwj8kVRFTfb41-M417OLr01MhQv0YCRucf31vcrzrcBOo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNNDXyw4o0OKdxHGrxllISD7sMmFmEXRCYdseLPaLPO-Q&oe=6ADF46D9"}, {"file_name": "Shot3.png", "id": "2659403194432547", "image_type":